+        <p>Build a research career from a small local vessel to major Arctic expeditions. Recruit scientists, equip your ship, win grants, complete field missions and publish the results.</p>
+        <div class="title-actions">
+          <button id="continue-button" class="primary hidden" type="button">CONTINUE EXPEDITION</button>
+          <button id="start-button" class="primary" type="button">NEW GAME</button>
+          <button id="save-button" class="secondary hidden" type="button">SAVE GAME</button>
+          <button id="load-button" class="secondary" type="button">LOAD GAME</button>
+          <button id="how-button" class="secondary" type="button">HOW TO PLAY</button>
+          <button id="resume-button" class="secondary hidden" type="button">RETURN TO EXPEDITION</button>
+        </div>
+        <p id="continue-summary" class="save-summary"></p>
+      </div>
+      <div id="title-load" class="title-pane hidden">
+        <button class="title-back" data-title-back type="button">&larr; BACK</button>
+        <small>LOCAL BROWSER SAVES</small>
+        <h2>Load an expedition</h2>
+        <p>Saves are stored only in this browser on this device.</p>
+        <div id="load-slots" class="save-slots"></div>
+      </div>
+      <div id="title-save" class="title-pane hidden">
+        <button class="title-back" data-title-back type="button">&larr; BACK</button>
+        <small>LOCAL BROWSER SAVES</small>
+        <h2>Save expedition</h2>
+        <p>Choose one of three manual save slots. The game also keeps a separate automatic save.</p>
+        <div id="save-slots" class="save-slots"></div>
+      </div>
+      <div id="title-help" class="title-pane hidden">
+        <button class="title-back" data-title-back type="button">&larr; BACK</button>
+        <small>HOW TO PLAY</small>
+        <h2>Build an Arctic research program</h2>
+        <div class="how-grid">
+          <article><b>1. PREPARE</b><span>Recruit scientists, buy instruments and accept grants that match your team's capabilities.</span></article>
+          <article><b>2. SAIL</b><span>Navigate between Arctic ports and research sites while managing fuel, food, weather and sea ice.</span></article>
+          <article><b>3. RESEARCH</b><span>Complete field stations and missions to collect scientific data and sponsor payments.</span></article>
+          <article><b>4. PUBLISH</b><span>Turn your data into papers, citations, promotions and stronger research funding.</span></article>
+          <article><b>5. GROW</b><span>Upgrade vessels, expand your team and tackle increasingly ambitious Arctic science.</span></article>
+        </div>
+        <button id="help-start-button" class="primary" type="button">BEGIN EXPEDITION</button>
+      </div>
     </section>
     <section id="game-over" class="game-over hud hidden" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="game-over-title">
       <small>EXPEDITION ENDED</small><h2 id="game-over-title">OUT OF FUEL</h2><p id="game-over-message">The vessel is stranded and the expedition cannot continue.</p>
